# desc: 건물–층–실의 포함 계층은 어떻게 구성되어 있는가? — 구역 질의의 기준 골격
# suite: space
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?building ?floor ?room
WHERE {
  ?building a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Building .
  ?building brick:hasPart|^brick:isPartOf ?floor .
  ?floor a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Floor .
  ?floor brick:hasPart|^brick:isPartOf ?room .
  ?room a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Room .
}
ORDER BY ?building ?floor ?room
